Punishment, a Justice Spell, is a simple card that originally dealt 3 DMG to anyone you want at the cost of 2G. '''Beta 4.6''' increased it to its current 3G. This stayed like that for a long time until '''Beta 20.2''', where it was buffed to deal 4 DMG if the enemy had more HP than you.

This stayed for a long time again, this time until '''Beta 46.1''', where it now always deals 4 DMG, but can no longer target a player.
=== Stats ===
SOUL Type: Justice

Cost:
* 2 (Post Alpha 3.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 4.6, Current)
Effects:
* Deal 3 DMG. (Post Alpha 3.0)
* Deal 3 DMG. If the enemy has more HP, deal 4 DMG instead. (Post Beta 20.2)
* Deal 4 DMG to a monster. (Post Beta 46.1, Current)

Rarities:
* White (Common) (Post Alpha 3.0)
* Gray (Basic) (Post Beta 30.0, Current)

